{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25467","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 流盃亭 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 流盃亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"激水自山椒，析波分浅濑。\n回环疑古篆，诘曲如萦带。\n宁愬羽觞迟，惟欢亲友会。\n欲知中圣处，皓月临松盖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25467.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25467","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}